    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c688565f6c2baf5303df9d54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从零开始……伏特加似乎想找出自己追寻的\n目标，与自己真正想要的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ca3e9c06de2839768f0a1cff3509987bc015fc1703b55fa2ba8a48838fba8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
